{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:38 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b97d3a4fbb947555d9498d6f1266c5a3/2026-11/202609014-__0.png\"/>\n<p>環亞拍賣行發言人表示，大角咀亮賢居一個高層複式大宅銀主盤，面積2,429方呎，屬4房3套設計，附連930方呎天台及78方呎平台，天台特設按摩浴池。銀主盤連兩個車位開拍價4,080萬元，較銀行估價的4,957萬低877萬元或約18%，呎價約16,797元，將於下周二（24日）拍賣，同場共有約59項物業可供競投。</p>\n<h3>大角咀亮賢居銀主盤：</h3>\n<img alt=\"大角咀亮賢居一個高層複式大宅銀主盤，面積2,429方呎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fde9310f9a2f56be623e89c1939314f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_33_58.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單位附連930方呎天台及78方呎平台，天台特設按摩浴池。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53b87a9097a4115a147f60dc14ede59a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_34_00.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單位面積2,429方呎，屬4房3套設計。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/040148253bc6807e1e01d28af4918370/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_33_59.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5b1d07aeefb009c93843f5dcc965126/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_33_59_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35064694c045c0a570b7c26d4871f0d1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_33_59_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a78c719a74b778799b81ac86752333d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_33_59_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>黃開基拍賣行發言人指，大圍世界花園3座中高層B室銀主盤，面積約1,800方呎，4房套連工人套房設計，銀主連同兩個車位開價1,480萬元推拍，較銀行估價的2,100萬低620萬元或約30%，呎價約8,222元，將於本周三（18日）拍賣，同場共有約28項物業可供競投。</p>\n<h3>大圍世界花園銀主盤：</h3>\n<img alt=\"大圍世界花園3座中高層B室銀主盤，連同兩個車位開價1,480萬元推拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1dbe317d9f8250e96191acb2e21c334c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_34_58_1_.jpeg\" title=\"大圍世界花園3座中高層B室銀主盤，連同兩個車位開價1,480萬元推拍。\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46e0ca8cfb4f9d3e04d7e1d97d9fec39/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_34_58.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/151cd1cdf83bcb0193b041e354421d3c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_34_59.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c807f119213b5a3cd53a3b946e32ef6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_34_59_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>忠誠拍賣行發言人表示，北角寶馬花園1座低層A室，面積473方呎，3房間隔，單位屬業主盤，開拍價498萬元，較銀行估價的620萬低122萬元或約20%，呎價約10,529元，將於本周三（18日）拍賣，同場共有約17項物業可供競投。</p>\n<h3>北角寶馬花園業主盤：</h3>\n<img alt=\"北角寶馬花園1座低層A室，面積473方呎，單位屬業主盤，開拍價498萬元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9a57da076b3b091ef5d230bbfc89de6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_34_33.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/875edba8b3910ed97e04d7beda812d33/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_34_33_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67c968ac85d296ce50ee3e8de7dc821f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_34_34_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85fdabd8926ee7a498f9b05827670390/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_34_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b057125a54b61222ae66edb646b6b822/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_14_34_34_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>相關文章：</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T07:16:47.933681+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":468,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T06:38:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T14:15:55.472185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T07:10:44.931348+00:00","content_hash":"e2abc57eaec12a461a6c6d3ac7eede2e00a0a2d3e58c96f77d602a0d12730637","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}